            "title": "Outer Casing",
            "instructions": [
                "Remove the two Phillips #00 screws:",
                "One Phillips 16mm screw",
                "One Phillips 14 mm screw",
                "All of the hair dryer's components are held together by these two screws. Parts may quickly separate after screw removal. Tape can be used to hold everything in place."
